  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 1
    text: You sit down and have a thorough review with the client, and suggest that
      for items they are unsure about you add in 'provisional sums'. These prov sums
      are estimates of what you believe the items on the exclusions or clarification
      lists will cost, even though you are not sure if they are required at this
      stage.
